1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,640
Two: the verb becomes be plus the past participle, with be in the same tense as the active verb.

2
00:00:06,640 --> 00:00:09,752
Planted is simple past, so were planted.

3
00:00:09,752 --> 00:00:14,921
Three: the old subject becomes the agent, with by: by the gardener.

4
00:00:14,921 --> 00:00:17,200
The roses were planted by the gardener.

